# 50 — Independent Evidence

Always applicable.

Every gate record declares:

- `thingBeingCertified`
- `independentEvidenceSource`

Independent evidence must be materially distinct from the thing being certified.

Reject self-validation, including:

- a source model checked only against the same source model
- a ledger checked only against the same ledger
- a mutable working-tree golden checked only against the same mutable golden
- a newly generated freeze checked only against the same newly generated freeze

When a gate requires independent evidence, builder-only evidence cannot satisfy it.

`docs/gold-standard/CERTIFICATION_LANGUAGE.md` and `tools/chapter_qa/` are the machine contract.
